title: NPC2
---
NPC2: This machine doesn't work.
NPC2: Don't you have a mechanic for this sort of thing?
You: No, I'm sorry. It's just me.
NPC2: Still?
You: ...
You: I'll take a look at it. Give me one second. 
<<deactivate_npc NPCManager>>

===
title: Rosaline
---
Rosaline: Hey, Casey.
Rosaline: Tom's got you on the floor alone again, huh?
    -> Yeah...
    -> I'll take the hours.
Rosaline: You want a drink?
    -> On the clock?
    -> You know I'm not old enough.
Rosaline: Like that's ever stopped anyone else.
Rosaline: Well, anyways. It's slow, right?
    -> It's always slow.
    -> And?
Rosaline: Mind watching the bar for me while I smoke?
    -> There it is...
    -> You'd go smoke either way.
Rosaline: You know me well. Be right back.
<pretend a minigame happens here>
Rosaline: Thanks for your help, Casey.
<<deactivate_npc NPCManager>>
===
title: Tom
---
Tom: Well, Casey. I'm finished up here for the night. 
Tom: Watch the floor. Don't bother locking up when you leave. Rosaline's got it.
Tom: Someone needs something, you help them. No questions asked. Got it?
Tom: And, y'know, keep an eye out for anything strange.
Tom: Damn spirits are driving our customers away.
-> Okay. I understand.
Tom: Good. I'm trusting you, Casey. Don't make me regret it.
<<deactivate_npc NPCManager>>


